    "updated_at": "2015-12-24T18:02:42Z",
    "body": "> I took this idea and ran with it in a second commit here. Let me know what you think.\n\nThis rocks—great stuff.\n\n> Although it's a shame you have to edit .git/config for every repo.\n\nActually, see https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/c6aaa7eb038ac3e76a1d033061165225820a7930 where I added the command to run to globally enable the behavior—\n\n```\ngit config --global --add remote.origin.fetch \"+refs/pull/*/head:refs/remotes/origin/pr/*\"\n```\n\nAnyway, please take a look at it again and make sure it’s right, or make further refinements as needed.\n",
